# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*credentials*.json
client_secret*.json
service-account*.json
google-credentials*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
.aws/
**/.aws/
aws-credentials*
.gcloud/
**/.gcloud/
.azure/
**/.azure/
.serverless/
**/.serverless/
.terraform/
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.vercel
